  "text": "Skip to content\nSearch\n⌘\nK\n\nDress Like Mommy\n\nHome\nOrders\n6\nProducts\nCustomers\nMarketing\nDiscounts\nContent\nMarkets\nFinance\nAnalytics\nSales channels\nOnline Store\nPoint of Sale\nGoogle & YouTube\nPinterest\nApps\nT Lab - AI Language Translate\nSidekick conversations\nUnderstanding Shopify pixels for tracking\nCreating and managing blog posts in Shopify\nCreating Mother's Day gift collection\nSettings\nLast 30 days\nAll channels\nNext payout: $53.09\n6 orders to fulfill\nGood afternoon, let's get started.\n\nRecover sales with your abandoned checkout email\n\nAn automated email is already created for you. Take a moment to review the email and make any additional adjustments to the design, messaging, or recipient list.\n\nReview email\nYour marketing data will soon be optimized\n\nShopify will soon monitor your data sharing to see if it’s driving results. When it isn’t, data pauses to limit oversharing, and starts again when it's needed.\n\nReview settings\nLearn more\nConnect with customers quickly using Shopify Messaging\n\nCreate branded emails in minutes with a drag-and-drop editor and templates that showcase products, checkout links, and discounts. Send your first 10,000 emails free every month.\n\nSend an email\nLearn more\nAutomate welcome emails for new subscribers\n\nYour customers want to hear from you after they sign up. Send a welcome email with a discount to encourage their first purchase.\n\nCreate welcome automation\nLearn more\nMeasure your return on ad spend\n\nGet unbiased insights into your ad performance data right from Shopify. Sync data from important channels, like Google and Instagram, to more easily compare metrics and decide how to improve.\n\nView channel insights\nLearn more\nBoost confidence with split shipping in checkout\n\nGive your customers more clarity at checkout by showing them when an order will be delivered in multiple shipments.\n\nGo to shipping settings\nLearn more\nApps you can trust with your business\n\nBuilt for Shopify apps are quality-tested to work reliably without slowing you down. We've selected the best ones specifically for your store type.\n\nView recommended picks\nAdd your logo to emails in Apple Mail\n\nCreate a consistent brand presence across apps that your customers use every day, like Apple Mail. Register for free with Apple Business and give your emails added visual appeal with Branded Mail.\n\nSign up\nGet help growing your business with Shopify Partners\n\nConnect with a network of skilled professionals offering a wide range of services to help you grow faster.\n\nFind a Partner\nA built-in taxonomy to power products\n\nIt's now easier to create and classify products to drive better product discovery and cross-channel selling, with over 10,000 product categories and and 2,000+ associated attributes using powerful AI.\n\nAdd product\nLearn more\nAdd a customer account menu to your online store\n\nAdd the account component to your theme so customers can sign in and stay on your store, or navigate to account pages right from the header.\n\nLearn more\nGrow your email list with Shopify Forms\n\nExpand your list of contacts and convert new leads with Shopify’s customizable forms tool. Set up pop up, overlay, and in-line forms, for free.\n\nInstall Shopify Forms\nLearn more\nMinimize impacts of new international trade regulations\n\nStay informed about upcoming changes to the global trade environment and learn how to protect your business, customers, and bottom line.\n\nRead guide\nA simpler way to adjust inventory is now live\n\nUpdate inventory quantities with \"Set To\" or \"Adjust By\". You’ll see what changed on each row and every adjustment now records source, destination and who made the change.\n\nLearn more\nCustomize order status and thank you pages with apps\n\nAll plans can now use apps to add functionality to the order status and thank you pages in a way that's secure and upgrade-safe, from the checkout and accounts editor.\n\nCustomize checkout\nLearn more\nAll caught up\nDiscover more of ShopifyBrowse features, apps, and sales channels to grow your business\nExplore now\nDrive trafficUse marketing tools to attract more potential customers.\nImprove conversionConvert more customers faster with built-in tools.\nIncrease order valueBoost sales by expanding to new channels, offering bundles, and more.\nResize Sidebar",
